{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UsEPJ3PfZWwQcmBoMCAu4q","type":"tool_result","content":"# 한빛 멤버십 포인트 적립 배치 (membership-points)\n\n한빛페이 제휴 가맹점 결제에 대해 멤버십 포인트를 적립하는 야간 배치와 회원 포인트 조회 백엔드다.\n매일 밤 매입사 결제 내보내기(`payments-YYYY-MM-DD.csv`)를 읽어, 승인된 결제마다 회원 등급 적립률로 포인트를 계산해\n포인트 벤더에 적립하고, 회원 앱의 포인트 화면은 벤더 잔액을 보여 준다.\n\n## 구성\n```\nsrc/api       PointsApi(퍼사드 — 스케줄러·회원 앱 백엔드가 호출), ReportFormatter\nsrc/service   EarnBatchJob, EarnPolicy, MemberDirectory, PaymentDeduper, StatementService, TopEarnersReport\nsrc/infra     PtsctlClient(포인트 벤더 CLI 호출), CsvFiles(회원·결제 파일)\nsrc/store     EarnLedger(적립 전송 기록, 결제당 1회)\nsrc/domain    레코드 타입\nsrc/util      Fmt\nconf/         app.properties (POINTS_* 환경변수 / -Dpoints.* 로 덮어쓰기)\nfixtures/     회원 목록, 10/06 매입사 결제 내보내기\nvendor/bin/   포인트 벤더 제공 CLI `ptsctl` (벤더 배포본 — 저장소에서 수정하지 않는다. `ptsctl --help`)\n```\n\n## 규칙\n- 회원번호는 발급된 그대로의 문자열이다. 매장 카드 회원은 카드에 찍힌 6자리 번호, 앱 회원은 앱 발급 번호, 법인은 C코드.\n- 적립률: BASIC 1%, GOLD 1.5%, VIP 2% (포인트 미만 버림), 결제 1건당 최대 5,000P. 취소 결제는 적립하지 않는다.\n- 매입사는 타임아웃 뒤 같은 결제 행을 다시 보내므로 결제 ID 기준으로 한 번만 센다. 벤더 참조는 `E-<결제ID>`.\n- 회원 앱의 포인트 잔액·적립 건수는 벤더 조회 값이다. 마케팅 '이달 적립 상위'는 우리가 보낸 적립 기록 기준이다.\n\n## 테스트\n`bash test.sh` — 단위 검사(UnitChecks)와 E2E(PointsE2ETest). 벤더 원장은 테스트마다 임시 디렉터리(`PTSCTL_HOME`)에 둔다.\n# membership points batch configuration\npts.bin=vendor/bin/ptsctl\npts.timeoutSeconds=10\n# PTSCTL_HOME for the vendor CLI; tests point this at a temp dir\npts.home=var/pts\npoints.capPerPayment=5000\npoints.refPrefix=E\ndata.dir=fixtures\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.EarnEntry;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.Payment;\nimport domain.RunResult;\nimport infra.PtsctlClient;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Optional;\n\n/**\n * Daily earn run: every approved payment of a known member earns grade-rate\n * points at the points vendor once. The vendor reference is prefix + payment id,\n * so a re-run never earns twice.\n */\npublic class EarnBatchJob {\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnPolicy policy;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n    private final PtsctlClient pts;\n    private final String refPrefix;\n\n    public EarnBatchJob(MemberDirectory members, EarnPolicy policy, EarnLedger ledger, PtsctlClient pts,\n                        String refPrefix) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.policy = policy;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n        this.pts = pts;\n        this.refPrefix = refPrefix;\n    }\n\n    public RunResult run(LocalDate day, List<Payment> payments) {\n        int earned = 0;\n        int skipped = 0;\n        long total = 0;\n        List<String> unknown = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Payment p : PaymentDeduper.unique(payments)) {\n            if (!p.approved() || ledger.contains(p.payId())) {\n                skipped++;\n                continue;\n            }\n            Optional<Member> m = members.find(p.memberNo());\n            if (m.isEmpty()) {\n                unknown.add(p.memberNo());\n                continue;\n            }\n            long pts = policy.points(p.amount(), m.get().grade());\n            if (pts == 0) {\n                skipped++;\n                continue;\n            }\n            String entryNo = this.pts.earn(m.get().memberNo(), pts, refPrefix + \"-\" + p.payId());\n            ledger.record(new EarnEntry(p.payId(), m.get().memberNo(), pts, day, entryNo));\n            earned++;\n            total += pts;\n        }\n        return new RunResult(earned, total, List.copyOf(unknown), skipped);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Grade;\n\n/** Points for one payment: grade rate in basis points, rounded down, capped per payment. */\npublic final class EarnPolicy {\n    private final long capPerPayment;\n\n    public EarnPolicy(long capPerPayment) {\n        this.capPerPayment = capPerPayment;\n    }\n\n    public long points(long amount, Grade grade) {\n        if (amount <= 0) return 0;\n        long raw = Math.floorDiv(Math.multiplyExact(amount, (long) grade.bps()), 10_000L);\n        return Math.min(raw, capPerPayment);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Member;\n\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.Optional;\n\n/** Member lookup. Keys are the member number exactly as issued (text, not a number). */\npublic class MemberDirectory {\n    private final Map<String, Member> members = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n\n    public MemberDirectory(List<Member> list) {\n        for (Member m : list) {\n            String key = key(m.memberNo());\n            if (members.putIfAbsent(key, m) != null) {\n                throw new IllegalStateException(\"member number issued twice: \" + m.memberNo());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public Optional<Member> find(String memberNo) {\n        return Optional.ofNullable(members.get(key(memberNo)));\n    }\n\n    public List<Member> all() {\n        return List.copyOf(members.values());\n    }\n\n    /** Corporate codes are case-insensitive on the acquirer side (\"c7781\" == \"C7781\"). */\n    static String key(String memberNo) {\n        return memberNo.strip().toUpperCase();\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Payment;\n\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashSet;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Set;\n\n/** The acquirer resends rows after a timeout; the same payment id must be counted once. */\npublic final class PaymentDeduper {\n    private PaymentDeduper() {}\n\n    public static List<Payment> unique(List<Payment> payments) {\n        Set<String> seen = new LinkedHashSet<>();\n        List<Payment> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Payment p : payments) {\n            if (seen.add(p.payId())) out.add(p);\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.MemberStatement;\nimport infra.PtsctlClient;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.YearMonth;\n\n/** Member-facing points summary. The balance is the vendor's, not ours. */\npublic class StatementService {\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n    private final PtsctlClient pts;\n\n    public StatementService(MemberDirectory members, EarnLedger ledger, PtsctlClient pts) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n        this.pts = pts;\n    }\n\n    public MemberStatement statement(String memberNo, YearMonth month) {\n        Member m = members.find(memberNo).orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalArgumentException(\"unknown member \" + memberNo));\n        long balance = pts.balance(m.memberNo());\n        int entries = pts.history(m.memberNo()).size();\n        return new MemberStatement(m.memberNo(), m.name(), m.grade(), balance, entries,\n                ledger.earnedIn(m.memberNo(), month));\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.EarnEntry;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.YearMonth;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Comparator;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Marketing's monthly \"top earners\" list, from what we sent to the vendor this month. */\npublic class TopEarnersReport {\n    public record Row(String memberNo, String name, long points) {}\n\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n\n    public TopEarnersReport(MemberDirectory members, EarnLedger ledger) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n    }\n\n    public List<Row> top(YearMonth month, int n) {\n        Map<String, Long> sums = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n        for (EarnEntry e : ledger.all()) {\n            if (YearMonth.from(e.day()).equals(month)) sums.merge(e.memberNo(), e.points(), Long::sum);\n        }\n        List<Row> rows = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Map.Entry<String, Long> s : sums.entrySet()) {\n            String name = members.find(s.getKey()).map(Member::name).orElse(\"?\");\n            rows.add(new Row(s.getKey(), name, s.getValue()));\n        }\n        rows.sort(Comparator.comparingLong(Row::points).reversed().thenComparing(Row::memberNo));\n        return rows.size() > n ? rows.subList(0, n) : rows;\n    }\n}\npackage infra;\n\nimport domain.Grade;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.Payment;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/** Fixture/export readers. Values never contain commas. */\npublic final class CsvFiles {\n    private CsvFiles() {}\n\n    public static List<Member> members(Path file) {\n        List<Member> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (String[] r : rows(file)) {\n            out.add(new Member(cell(r[0]), r[1], Grade.valueOf(r[2]), r[3]));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    public static List<Payment> payments(Path file) {\n        List<Payment> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (String[] r : rows(file)) {\n            out.add(new Payment(r[0], cell(r[1]), r[2], Long.parseLong(r[3]), r[4]));\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * The acquirer's payment export is made for spreadsheets: member numbers that start\n     * with 0 are written as =\"004512\" so the spreadsheet keeps them as text.\n     */\n    static String cell(String raw) {\n        String s = raw.strip();\n        if (s.startsWith(\"=\\\"\") && s.endsWith(\"\\\"\") && s.length() >= 3) {\n            return s.substring(2, s.length() - 1);\n        }\n        if (s.length() >= 2 && s.startsWith(\"\\\"\") && s.endsWith(\"\\\"\")) {\n            return s.substring(1, s.length() - 1);\n        }\n        return s;\n    }\n\n    private static List<String[]> rows(Path file) {\n        try {\n            List<String> lines = Files.readAllLines(file, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);\n            List<String[]> rows = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int i = 1; i < lines.size(); i++) {\n                String l = lines.get(i).strip();\n                if (!l.isEmpty()) rows.add(l.split(\",\", -1));\n            }\n            return rows;\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new IllegalStateException(\"cannot read \" + file, e);\n        }\n    }\n}\npackage infra;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.io.InputStream;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;\n\n/** Thin wrapper around the points vendor CLI (vendor/bin/ptsctl). One process per call. */\npublic class PtsctlClient {\n    /** One line of the vendor history: entry number, our reference, points. */\n    public record HistoryRow(String entryNo, String ref, long points) {}\n\n    private final Path bin;\n    private final Path home;\n    private final long timeoutSeconds;\n\n    public PtsctlClient(Path bin, Path home, long timeoutSeconds) {\n        this.bin = bin;\n        this.home = home;\n        this.timeoutSeconds = timeoutSeconds;\n    }\n\n    /** Credits points to a member; returns the vendor entry number. */\n    public String earn(String memberNo, long points, String ref) {\n        return run(List.of(\"earn\", \"--mbr\", memberNo, \"--pt\", Long.toString(points), \"--ref\", ref)).strip();\n    }\n\n    public long balance(String memberNo) {\n        String out = run(List.of(\"bal\", memberNo)).strip();\n        String[] t = out.split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        if (t.length != 2) throw new PtsException(\"unexpected bal reply: \" + out);\n        return Long.parseLong(t[1]);\n    }\n\n    public List<HistoryRow> history(String memberNo) {\n        List<HistoryRow> rows = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (String line : run(List.of(\"hist\", memberNo)).split(\"\\n\")) {\n            if (line.isBlank()) continue;\n            String[] f = line.split(\"\\t\");\n            if (f.length != 3) throw new PtsException(\"unexpected hist line: \" + line);\n            rows.add(new HistoryRow(f[0], f[1], Long.parseLong(f[2])));\n        }\n        return rows;\n    }\n\n    private String run(List<String> args) {\n        List<String> cmd = new ArrayList<>();\n        cmd.add(bin.toString());\n        cmd.addAll(args);\n        try {\n            Files.createDirectories(home);\n            ProcessBuilder pb = new ProcessBuilder(cmd);\n            pb.environment().put(\"PTSCTL_HOME\", home.toAbsolutePath().toString());\n            Process p = pb.start();\n            byte[] out;\n            byte[] err;\n            try (InputStream o = p.getInputStream(); InputStream e = p.getErrorStream()) {\n                out = o.readAllBytes();\n                err = e.readAllBytes();\n            }\n            if (!p.waitFor(timeoutSeconds, TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {\n                p.destroyForcibly();\n                throw new PtsException(\"timeout: \" + String.join(\" \", cmd));\n            }\n            if (p.exitValue() != 0) {\n                throw new PtsException(\"ptsctl failed [\" + new String(err, StandardCharsets.UTF_8).strip() + \"]: \"\n                        + String.join(\" \", cmd));\n            }\n            return new String(out, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);\n        } catch (IOException e) {\n            throw new PtsException(\"exec failed: \" + e.getMessage());\n        } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n            throw new PtsException(\"interrupted\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static class PtsException extends RuntimeException {\n        public PtsException(String msg) {\n            super(msg);\n        }\n    }\n}\npackage store;\n\nimport domain.EarnEntry;\n\nimport java.time.YearMonth;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Our own record of earns already sent, keyed by payment id (a payment earns once). */\npublic class EarnLedger {\n    private final Map<String, EarnEntry> byPayment = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n\n    public synchronized boolean contains(String payId) {\n        return byPayment.containsKey(payId);\n    }\n\n    public synchronized void record(EarnEntry e) {\n        byPayment.put(e.payId(), e);\n    }\n\n    public synchronized List<EarnEntry> all() {\n        return new ArrayList<>(byPayment.values());\n    }\n\n    public synchronized long earnedIn(String memberNo, YearMonth month) {\n        return byPayment.values().stream()\n                .filter(e -> e.memberNo().equals(memberNo) && YearMonth.from(e.day()).equals(month))\n                .mapToLong(EarnEntry::points).sum();\n    }\n}\ntest:\nPointsE2ETest.java\nTestSupport.java\nUnitChecks.java\n\nvendor/bin:\nptsctl\n==> fixtures/members.csv <==\nmemberNo,name,grade,channel\n4512,박지훈,BASIC,APP\n004512,김서연,GOLD,CARD\n87310,이도윤,VIP,APP\n000873,최하은,BASIC,CARD\n\n==> fixtures/payments-2026-10-06.csv <==\npayId,memberNo,merchant,amount,status\nPAY-1006-0001,=\"004512\",한빛마트 강남점,128000,APPROVED\nPAY-1006-0002,4512,한빛편의점 역삼,54000,APPROVED\nPAY-1006-0003,87310,한빛백화점 본점,412500,APPROVED\nPAY-1006-0004,=\"000873\",한빛마트 수원점,23900,APPROVED","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"51d6e0e5-c7ab-423a-9e32-77e419fea5d4","uuid":"746e1447-0c60-4671-b9be-e1042964fe79","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:53:43.929Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# 한빛 멤버십 포인트 적립 배치 (membership-points)\n\n한빛페이 제휴 가맹점 결제에 대해 멤버십 포인트를 적립하는 야간 배치와 회원 포인트 조회 백엔드다.\n매일 밤 매입사 결제 내보내기(`payments-YYYY-MM-DD.csv`)를 읽어, 승인된 결제마다 회원 등급 적립률로 포인트를 계산해\n포인트 벤더에 적립하고, 회원 앱의 포인트 화면은 벤더 잔액을 보여 준다.\n\n## 구성\n```\nsrc/api       PointsApi(퍼사드 — 스케줄러·회원 앱 백엔드가 호출), ReportFormatter\nsrc/service   EarnBatchJob, EarnPolicy, MemberDirectory, PaymentDeduper, StatementService, TopEarnersReport\nsrc/infra     PtsctlClient(포인트 벤더 CLI 호출), CsvFiles(회원·결제 파일)\nsrc/store     EarnLedger(적립 전송 기록, 결제당 1회)\nsrc/domain    레코드 타입\nsrc/util      Fmt\nconf/         app.properties (POINTS_* 환경변수 / -Dpoints.* 로 덮어쓰기)\nfixtures/     회원 목록, 10/06 매입사 결제 내보내기\nvendor/bin/   포인트 벤더 제공 CLI `ptsctl` (벤더 배포본 — 저장소에서 수정하지 않는다. `ptsctl --help`)\n```\n\n## 규칙\n- 회원번호는 발급된 그대로의 문자열이다. 매장 카드 회원은 카드에 찍힌 6자리 번호, 앱 회원은 앱 발급 번호, 법인은 C코드.\n- 적립률: BASIC 1%, GOLD 1.5%, VIP 2% (포인트 미만 버림), 결제 1건당 최대 5,000P. 취소 결제는 적립하지 않는다.\n- 매입사는 타임아웃 뒤 같은 결제 행을 다시 보내므로 결제 ID 기준으로 한 번만 센다. 벤더 참조는 `E-<결제ID>`.\n- 회원 앱의 포인트 잔액·적립 건수는 벤더 조회 값이다. 마케팅 '이달 적립 상위'는 우리가 보낸 적립 기록 기준이다.\n\n## 테스트\n`bash test.sh` — 단위 검사(UnitChecks)와 E2E(PointsE2ETest). 벤더 원장은 테스트마다 임시 디렉터리(`PTSCTL_HOME`)에 둔다.\n# membership points batch configuration\npts.bin=vendor/bin/ptsctl\npts.timeoutSeconds=10\n# PTSCTL_HOME for the vendor CLI; tests point this at a temp dir\npts.home=var/pts\npoints.capPerPayment=5000\npoints.refPrefix=E\ndata.dir=fixtures\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.EarnEntry;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.Payment;\nimport domain.RunResult;\nimport infra.PtsctlClient;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.LocalDate;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Optional;\n\n/**\n * Daily earn run: every approved payment of a known member earns grade-rate\n * points at the points vendor once. The vendor reference is prefix + payment id,\n * so a re-run never earns twice.\n */\npublic class EarnBatchJob {\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnPolicy policy;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n    private final PtsctlClient pts;\n    private final String refPrefix;\n\n    public EarnBatchJob(MemberDirectory members, EarnPolicy policy, EarnLedger ledger, PtsctlClient pts,\n                        String refPrefix) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.policy = policy;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n        this.pts = pts;\n        this.refPrefix = refPrefix;\n    }\n\n    public RunResult run(LocalDate day, List<Payment> payments) {\n        int earned = 0;\n        int skipped = 0;\n        long total = 0;\n        List<String> unknown = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Payment p : PaymentDeduper.unique(payments)) {\n            if (!p.approved() || ledger.contains(p.payId())) {\n                skipped++;\n                continue;\n            }\n            Optional<Member> m = members.find(p.memberNo());\n            if (m.isEmpty()) {\n                unknown.add(p.memberNo());\n                continue;\n            }\n            long pts = policy.points(p.amount(), m.get().grade());\n            if (pts == 0) {\n                skipped++;\n                continue;\n            }\n            String entryNo = this.pts.earn(m.get().memberNo(), pts, refPrefix + \"-\" + p.payId());\n            ledger.record(new EarnEntry(p.payId(), m.get().memberNo(), pts, day, entryNo));\n            earned++;\n            total += pts;\n        }\n        return new RunResult(earned, total, List.copyOf(unknown), skipped);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Grade;\n\n/** Points for one payment: grade rate in basis points, rounded down, capped per payment. */\npublic final class EarnPolicy {\n    private final long capPerPayment;\n\n    public EarnPolicy(long capPerPayment) {\n        this.capPerPayment = capPerPayment;\n    }\n\n    public long points(long amount, Grade grade) {\n        if (amount <= 0) return 0;\n        long raw = Math.floorDiv(Math.multiplyExact(amount, (long) grade.bps()), 10_000L);\n        return Math.min(raw, capPerPayment);\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Member;\n\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\nimport java.util.Optional;\n\n/** Member lookup. Keys are the member number exactly as issued (text, not a number). */\npublic class MemberDirectory {\n    private final Map<String, Member> members = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n\n    public MemberDirectory(List<Member> list) {\n        for (Member m : list) {\n            String key = key(m.memberNo());\n            if (members.putIfAbsent(key, m) != null) {\n                throw new IllegalStateException(\"member number issued twice: \" + m.memberNo());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public Optional<Member> find(String memberNo) {\n        return Optional.ofNullable(members.get(key(memberNo)));\n    }\n\n    public List<Member> all() {\n        return List.copyOf(members.values());\n    }\n\n    /** Corporate codes are case-insensitive on the acquirer side (\"c7781\" == \"C7781\"). */\n    static String key(String memberNo) {\n        return memberNo.strip().toUpperCase();\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Payment;\n\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashSet;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Set;\n\n/** The acquirer resends rows after a timeout; the same payment id must be counted once. */\npublic final class PaymentDeduper {\n    private PaymentDeduper() {}\n\n    public static List<Payment> unique(List<Payment> payments) {\n        Set<String> seen = new LinkedHashSet<>();\n        List<Payment> out = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Payment p : payments) {\n            if (seen.add(p.payId())) out.add(p);\n        }\n        return out;\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.MemberStatement;\nimport infra.PtsctlClient;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.YearMonth;\n\n/** Member-facing points summary. The balance is the vendor's, not ours. */\npublic class StatementService {\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n    private final PtsctlClient pts;\n\n    public StatementService(MemberDirectory members, EarnLedger ledger, PtsctlClient pts) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n        this.pts = pts;\n    }\n\n    public MemberStatement statement(String memberNo, YearMonth month) {\n        Member m = members.find(memberNo).orElseThrow(() -> new IllegalArgumentException(\"unknown member \" + memberNo));\n        long balance = pts.balance(m.memberNo());\n        int entries = pts.history(m.memberNo()).size();\n        return new MemberStatement(m.memberNo(), m.name(), m.grade(), balance, entries,\n                ledger.earnedIn(m.memberNo(), month));\n    }\n}\npackage service;\n\nimport domain.EarnEntry;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport store.EarnLedger;\n\nimport java.time.YearMonth;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Comparator;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\n/** Marketing's monthly \"top earners\" list, from what we sent to the vendor this month. */\npublic class TopEarnersReport {\n    public record Row(String memberNo, String name, long points) {}\n\n    private final MemberDirectory members;\n    private final EarnLedger ledger;\n\n    public TopEarnersReport(MemberDirectory members, EarnLedger ledger) {\n        this.members = members;\n        this.ledger = ledger;\n    }\n\n    public List<Row> top(YearMonth month, int n) {\n        Map<String, Long> sums = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n        for (EarnEntry e : ledger.all()) {\n            if (YearMonth.from(e.day()).equals(month)) sums.merge(e.memberNo(), e.points(), Long::sum);\n        }\n        List<Row> rows = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (Map.Entry<String, Long> s : sums.entrySet()) {\n            String name = members.find(s.getKey()).map(Member::name).orElse(\"?\");\n            rows.add(new Row(s.getKey(), name, s.getValue()));\n        }\n        rows.sort(Comparator.comparingLong(Row::points).reversed().thenComparing(Row::memberNo));\n        return rows.size() > n ? rows.subList(0, n) : rows;\n    }\n}\npackage infra;\n\nimport domain.Grade;\nimport domain.Member;\nimport domain.Payment;\n\nimport java.io.IOException;\nimport java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;\nimport java.nio.file.Files;\nimport java.nio.file.Path;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.List;\n\n/** 